<div class="entry-content clear" data-ast-blocks-layout="true" itemprop="text">
<p>Welcome to IAESTE! We are the International Association for the Exchange of Students for Technical Experience, a global organization dedicated to providing university students with international opportunities in the technical field. Through our extensive network in over 90 countries, we offer exchange programs that allow students to gain relevant work experience abroad while exploring new cultures and developing intercultural skills.</p>

<p><strong>What do we offer?</strong></p>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Professional Internships: </strong>IAESTE connects university students with leading companies and organizations in different countries, providing the opportunity to carry out paid professional internships in their field of study. These internships help students apply their theoretical knowledge in real work environments and develop valuable practical skills for their professional future.</li>

<li><strong>Cultural Exchange:</strong> Our exchange program is not only about work, we also encourage cultural immersion and the creation of lasting friendships. Students have the opportunity to live in another country during their stay, experiencing first-hand daily life, traditions and local culture. In addition, we organize social events, excursions and activities to ensure participants make the most of their international experience.</li>

<li><strong>Red global: </strong>Being part of IAESTE means joining a global network of students, alumni, employers and universities committed to international exchange and technical cooperation. This network provides students with access to valuable professional connections and career development opportunities around the world.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Why choose IAESTE?</strong></p>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Relevant Experience:</strong> IAESTE offers students the opportunity to gain work experience in their field of study, giving them a competitive advantage in the global job market.</li>

<li><strong>Personal Development:</strong> Living and working in a culturally diverse environment allows students to develop intercultural skills, adaptability, confidence and personal maturity.</li>

<li><strong>International Friendships:</strong> IAESTE is a welcoming and diverse community where students can establish lasting international friendships and expand their professional network.</li>

<li><strong>Apoyo integral:</strong> From the application process to the completion of the experience, IAESTE provides solid support to students, including advice, guidance and assistance with logistical issues.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Upcoming calls:</strong></p>

<p>If you are interested in participating in an IAESTE exchange program, check our upcoming calls and eligibility requirements on our website. Do not miss the opportunity to enrich your university experience and expand your horizons!</p>

<p>Join IAESTE and discover a world of international opportunities!</p>

</div>
